    "description": "Previously used as a SFH this thoughtfully renovated 2-unit building offers spectacular southern views w/ 3 decks & huge yard. The upper unit showcases a bright 2 bedroom layout flooded w/ light. The spacious living room features oversized windows framing stunning views + built-in shelving. Through the formal dining area & into the chef's kitchen, find SS appliances, wood shelving & skylight. 2 well-appointed bedrooms, a modern bath, & good storage. Next find an exceptional bi-level owners unit w/ the same enviable views & refined finish. As you enter, you're greeted by the unique bonus room w/ custom barn doors, perfect for a home office. Continuing down the hall, you'll pass the first full bath & then to the spacious remodeled kitchen w/ marble countertops, custom walnut cabinetry, & premium appliances. The adjacent dining/living area opens to one of 3 large south-facing decks, perfect for al fresco dining. Downstairs find the living room, complete w/ a wall of built-in shelving & bedroom featuring a custom walk-through closet & en-suite bath, W/D. Radiant heat, water filtration system. Updated systems. Yard w/ lawn, fruit trees (fig, apple, lemon & lime), tomatoes & grapes. Interior garage access, solar panels (owned) & structural upgrades. Delivered vacant. MUST SEE."
  },
